oath/oath
oathrs/target/
.claude/

# Signing keys and bearer tokens must never enter the repository. `oath keygen`
# writes <prefix>.key (private) and <prefix>.pub (public) into the working
# directory, and a tokens file is a plain-JSON list of shared secrets — both are
# one `git add -A` away from being published in an append-only, tamper-evident
# journal that also happens to be a public git history.
*.key
*.pem
tokens.json
*tokens.json
